{
  "title": "ISic002135. Funerary epitaph for Besson",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: <a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/4MCP2PVV\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/4MCP2PVV</a></div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Βέσσων\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Βέσσων\">Βέσσων</span></span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[χρ]η̣στὸς καὶ <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ἄμεμπτος <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>ἔζησεν <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ἔτη η´ <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>  <br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>[ἡ]μ̣έρας ζ´ </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: <a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/4MCP2PVV\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/4MCP2PVV</a></div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Βέσσων\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Βέσσων\">ΒΕΣΣΩΝ</span></span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[..].ΣΤΟΣΚΑΙ<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΑΜΕΜΠΤΟΣ<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>ΕΖΗΣΕΝ<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΕΤΗΗ<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span><br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>[.].ΕΡΑΣΖ</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text after Orsi 1912 and a low resolution photograph; fresh study is required</span></span>; </li><li><span class=\"1\">1: <span>In the inventory, the first line is marked as illegible, and only part of what Orsi claims to read in NSA is visible in the photograph, so the name cannot be considered certain</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>Besson, worthy and blameless, lived 8 years, [x months?], 7 days.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Orsi NSA 1912 299 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Regular plain letters, lunate sigma and epsilon, cursive mu.</p> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
